# NewRMS Sign-Up API Test Cases
# Use this file with REST clients like IntelliJ HTTP Client, Postman, or curl

### 1. Get Sign-Up Form Structure
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/signup-form
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Check Username Availability (Available)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/check-username?username=newuser123
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Check Username Availability (Taken - if admin exists)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/check-username?username=admin
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Valid Sign-Up Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "username": "johndoe123",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "SecurePass123!",
  "roles": "WAITER"
}

### 5. Sign-Up with Weak Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "username": "janesmith",
  "password": "password",
  "confirmPassword": "password",
  "roles": "CHEF"
}

### 6. Sign-Up with Password Mismatch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Wilson",
  "username": "bobwilson",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "DifferentPass456@",
  "roles": "CASHIER"
}

### 7. Sign-Up with Invalid Name (Numbers)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John123",
  "username": "johnsmith",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "SecurePass123!",
  "roles": "MANAGER"
}

### 8. Sign-Up with Invalid Username (Special Characters)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Johnson",
  "username": "alice@johnson",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "SecurePass123!",
  "roles": "ADMIN"
}

### 9. Sign-Up with Invalid Role
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mike Brown",
  "username": "mikebrown",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "SecurePass123!",
  "roles": "INVALID_ROLE"
}

### 10. Sign-Up with Multiple Roles
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Davis",
  "username": "sarahdavis",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "SecurePass123!",
  "roles": "MANAGER,CASHIER"
}

### 11. Duplicate Username Test (Run after successful registration)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another John",
  "username": "johndoe123",
  "password": "AnotherPass456@",
  "confirmPassword": "AnotherPass456@",
  "roles": "WAITER"
}

### 12. Validate Sign-Up Data (Test Endpoint)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/validate-signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "TestPass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "TestPass123!",
  "roles": "WAITER"
}

### 13. Rate Limiting Test (Run multiple times quickly)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rate Test User",
  "username": "ratetest1",
  "password": "RateTest123!",
  "confirmPassword": "RateTest123!",
  "roles": "WAITER"
}

### 14. Empty Fields Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "username": "",
  "password": "",
  "confirmPassword": "",
  "roles": ""
}

### 15. Missing Fields Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete User"
}